%% Card statuses on the board and their legal transitions.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued
    queued --> working: role claims it
    working --> merging: handoff accepted
    merging --> queued: next role has mail
    merging --> done: terminal handoff
    working --> waiting_approval: approval gate
    waiting_approval --> queued: approve or accept
    waiting_approval --> rejected: reject retry
    rejected --> working: role re-runs
    working --> clarifying: question
    clarifying --> working: answer
    working --> blocked: bounces exhausted
    blocked --> working: retry
    blocked --> queued: accept
    done --> [*]
